        tryIt: "In the Enterprise Connection Proxying: pgBouncer Transaction Pooling & Multiplexing code editor, adjust evaluatePgbouncerPoolingModes (currently 10) and totalClientPods to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
