        tryIt: "In the Sliding Window Counter Algorithm: Weighted Approximation for High-Throughput Gateways code editor, adjust computeSlidingWindowCounter (currently 60000) and prevWindowCount to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
