        tryIt: "In the Protocol Buffers Wire Format: Varints, Tag-Length-Value (TLV) & Zigzag Encoding code editor, adjust encodeProtobufVarint (currently 7) and value to test boundary conditions, then run the snippet and verify how the computed output responds.",
